                            <comment id="14392774" author="jongyoul" created="Thu, 2 Apr 2015 14:45:44 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I have a same issue. I thought it was my mistake.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14394063" author="githubbot" created="Fri, 3 Apr 2015 05:02:06 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user Leemoonsoo opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/26&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/26&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-22&quot; title=&quot;PySparkInterpreter hanging without error message&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-22&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-22&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; PySparkInterpreter hanging without error message&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    When something goes wrong, like misconfiguring spark.home property, %pyspark is hanging.&lt;br/&gt;
    This PR makes Zeppelin prints some error instead of waiting forever.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Here&apos;s example of error message printed when it failed to load py4j package. Previously it was just hanging.&lt;br/&gt;
    !&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;image&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/1540981/6978258/9e10caa8-da09-11e4-82da-80f935502f5b.png&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/1540981/6978258/9e10caa8-da09-11e4-82da-80f935502f5b.png&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;p&gt;You can merge this pull request into a Git repository by running:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    $ git pull &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Leemoonsoo/incubator-zeppelin&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/Leemoonsoo/incubator-zeppelin&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-22&quot; title=&quot;PySparkInterpreter hanging without error message&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-22&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-22&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Alternatively you can review and apply these changes as the patch at:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/26.patch&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/26.patch&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To close this pull request, make a commit to your master/trunk branch&lt;br/&gt;
with (at least) the following in the commit message:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    This closes #26&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;commit 59108255602f476d854d1e6e2291190101b80b0b&lt;br/&gt;
